# Chaos Ideas

## Idea 1
Name:
Random Tax Event
Description:
Periodically, all players lose a random percentage of their balance (5-50%)
Player interaction:
Public notification with dramatic sound and temporary UI flash
Why it could be fun:
Creates tension and forces players to hoard currency strategically
Implementation scope:
Add timer in CurrencyService, apply random deduction, broadcast to all players

## Idea 2
Name:
Balance Lottery
Description:
Randomly, a random player receives 1-100 currency units as a "mystery gift"
Player interaction:
Pop-up notification "You found 42 coins! Click to claim"
Why it could be fun:
Adds unpredictability and small dopamine hits for casual players
Implementation scope:
Random interval trigger in CurrencyService, generate random amount, call deposit on random player

## Idea 3
Name:
Double Spending Glitch
Description:
Randomly, when a player withdraws, their balance doesn't decrease (they "got away with it")
Player interaction:
Temporary debug-style message "Balance unchanged" appears briefly
Why it could be fun:
Creates a sense of glitchy RNG chaos, players will try repeatedly to trigger it
Implementation scope:
Random chance modifier in CurrencyService.withdraw(), occasionally skip the subtraction step
